nd having fun.\n\nThe one with horns (Ryuga) is energetic, always smiling, and loves EVESON.\nHe is a water dragon, so his arms and legs are not human-shaped.\nHis body is covered with blue scales, and his mouth and tongue are also blue.\n\nOn the other hand, the silver-haired and red-eyed one (EVESON) is an android with a quiet smile.\nIn image, he is like 2B of NieR: Automata.\n▽Resources\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-1ueYVD-x4UZVLqweeSgo5hWTQEC50sK?usp=sharing\n\nMatching dock tag style necklace.\nhttps://booth.pm/ja/items/3796171\nMatching clothes.\nhttps://booth.pm/ja/items/3771374\nMatching bracelets.\nhttps://twitter.com/3pond_rond/status/1470671158391762944\n\n▽Use outside of Skeb regulations.\nWe would appreciate your permission to use the following\nUse of cropped images as icons on VRChat, SNS sites, etc.\nDisplaying unedited images on my personal SNS or VRChat private world (*non-commercial use)\n\nThank you in advance.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-1ueYVD-x4UZVLqweeSgo5hWTQEC50sK?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@8_hatidori/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1561435, "client_id": 192873, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fee167b2/uploads/origins/fa8525ff-5475-47fd-aeb6-9e0e61a799d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ec30d0d724ad7d76c9cd9ee11d12cd9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fee167b2/uploads/origins/fa8525ff-5475-47fd-aeb6-9e0e61a799d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ec30d0d724ad7d76c9cd9ee11d12cd9, https://si.imgix.net/fee167b2/uploads/origins/fa8525ff-5475-47fd-aeb6-9e0e61a799d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04412a3e09b261775be0f527bf669520 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fee167b2/uploads/origins/fa8525ff-